# A prepare permanent stays prepared through the spell's mana payment, losing the designation only once cast
# (CR 722.3c, 601.2g-i). Payment uses the Island rather than floating mana, exposing the intermediate casting state.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Paradox Shaper
Island x35

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x35

[Actions]
[Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Paradox Shaper.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Paradox Shaper.Prepared = true
Bot1.Exile.Omit Variables.Cast
? Bot1.Battlefield.Paradox Shaper.Prepared = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
